<h2>Why Inspections Matter Here</h2>
<p>Roofs in Central Texas rarely fail all at once. They wear down gradually from heat and UV, then take sudden hits from hail and wind. Small problems such as a lifted shingle, a cracked pipe boot, or a loose piece of flashing can let water into the decking for months before a ceiling stain appears. Catching those early usually means a smaller, simpler <a href="/services/roof-repair-temple-tx/">roof repair</a> instead of rotted sheathing and interior damage.</p>

<h2>Signs You Should Schedule an Inspection</h2>
<ul>
<li>A hailstorm or high-wind event passed through your neighborhood</li>
