<li>Your roof is 10 to 15 years old or more and has not been looked at</li>
<li>You are buying, selling or refinancing a home</li>
<li>Your attic smells musty or feels damp</li>
<li>Higher-than-normal cooling bills along with a very hot attic</li>
</ul>

